# Four-ply info spelling: April 2006 UCI specification, info and Move format
# https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/#engine-info and fisher-8hc question 1
# (owner approval 2026-11-24). D3–D6 supply the allowances for the principal
# variation, time and nodes per second. The fisher-2aj.2 sources and
# comments below supply the retained scores, node counts and reply order.
# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions from 2026-11-22.
# Search: fisher-2aj rules 1 to 7 and 10. Exact search values
# were checked by exhaustive enumeration with python-chess 1.11.2.
# Every go searches 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b, because each rejected position
# leaves it in place.
# Mate -1 nodes 782: in 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b, black must play h8g8,
# then h6g7 is checkmate. Python-chess counts 1, 21, 30 and 730 nodes at
# plies 1 to 4.
# Searched transcript written 2026-11-23.
> position fen 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> position fen 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/7 b - - 0 1
# Owner decision for rejected position: one diagnostic for malformed FEN.
< info string {message:eight files}
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
# Owner-approved example: the original position still has its sole legal move.
< bestmove h8g8
> position startpos moves e2e4 e7e5 e4e6
# Owner decision for rejected position: one diagnostic for illegal move after two legal moves.
< info string {message:illegal UCI move e4e6}
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
# Owner-approved example: the original position still has its sole legal move.
< bestmove h8g8
> position startpos moves e2e4 e7e9
# Owner decision for rejected position: one diagnostic for malformed UCI move after a legal move.
< info string {message:malformed UCI move}
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
# Owner-approved example: the original position still has its sole legal move.
< bestmove h8g8
> position fen
# Owner decision for rejected position: one diagnostic for missing FEN.
< info string {message:expected FEN}
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
# Owner-approved example: the original position still has its sole legal move.
< bestmove h8g8
> position
< info string {message:expected startpos or fen}
> isready
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
< bestmove h8g8
> position startpos e2e4
< info string {message:expected moves}
> isready
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
< bestmove h8g8
> position startpos moves e2e4 0000
< info string {message:null move}
> isready
< readyok
> go
# Rules 4, 5, 7 and 10. See the header for mate -1 nodes 782.
< info depth 4 score mate -1 time {time} nodes 782 nps {nps} pv {pv}
< bestmove h8g8
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
